Package: lh-uboot-fuse-tool
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Sameer Tawade <ops@logihertz.com>
Homepage: https://www.logihertz.com
Description: lh-fuse - Monotonic Hardware OTP eFuse Transition Invariant
 Cryptographic Secure Boot OTP hardware eFuse provisioning utility synthesizing 4-slot Super Root Key (SRK/PKC) SHA-256 fuse tables, verifying irreversible 0->1 bit transitions, and generating U-Boot/Tegra234 fuse scripts.
